cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "memdec: reproducibility artifact for 'Decidability Before Maintenance'"
abstract: >-
  Data, measurement scripts and analysis code for a study of how LLM agents pick
  between conflicting memory records. The artifact recomputes every number in the
  manuscript from shipped condition files, and adds diagnostics the manuscript's
  own tables omit: exact binomial intervals, effective sample size, and the
  archive-coverage identity.
type: software
